' 8. Chat with the study assistant
' Use case: Chat with the study assistant (Communicate) · Actor: Learner · Secondary: AI service (Anthropic Claude)
'
' Design patterns:
'   - Strategy: «interface» AssistantProvider with claudeProvider and courseHelperProvider; activeProvider() picks
'     one (Claude when configured, otherwise the built-in course helper); the service calls them the same way
'     (services/assistant-providers.ts)
'   - Adapter: claudeProvider wraps the Anthropic SDK behind our AssistantProvider interface
'   - Unit of work: question and answer saved in one transaction
'   - Chain of responsibility: rateLimit (hourly limit) before the controller
'   - Repository
' Lifelines use BCE stereotypes: «boundary» screens and outside services, «control» use-case logic (controllers,
' services, and the adapter interfaces in front of outside services), «entity» stored data (repository, stores);
' the database keeps its own symbol.
@startuml 08 Chat with the study assistant
title 8. Chat with the study assistant
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Learner
boundary "Web app" as Web
control "Communication\ncontroller" as Ctrl
control "Assistant service" as Svc
control "«interface»\nAssistantProvider" as Provider
entity "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB
boundary "AI service\n(Claude)" as AI

Learner -> Web : type a question
Web -> Ctrl : POST /api/assistant/messages
note over Ctrl : «Chain of responsibility»\nauthenticate → hourly rate limit
alt over the limit
  Ctrl --> Web : 429
end
Ctrl -> Svc : ask(question)
Svc -> Repo : conversation's recent messages
Repo -> DB : SELECT
Svc -> Provider : activeProvider().answer(history, learner name + level)
note right of Provider : «Strategy»\nclaudeProvider or\ncourseHelperProvider
alt Claude configured
  Provider -> AI : Messages API
  note right of AI : «Adapter»: claudeProvider\nwraps the Anthropic SDK
  AI --> Provider : answer
else not configured
  Provider -> Provider : built-in course helper answer
end
Provider --> Svc : answer text
group «Unit of work» withTransaction()
  Svc -> Repo : conversation (new if none) + question + answer
  Repo -> DB : INSERT …
end
Ctrl --> Web : answer
Web --> Learner : show the answer
@enduml
